id=opal
title=Opal
description=Opal Quickshell with vendor EGL/GLES through libhybris and plug-and-play multi-monitor direct hwcomposer presentation.
backend=libhybris-hwcomposer
renderer=vendor-hybris
allocator=android-gralloc
presentation=multi-output-direct
input=evdev-grab
compositor=/usr/local/bin/aurora-hyprland-opal
shell=hyprland-config
required_binaries=/opt/aurorahyprland/bin/Hyprland,/opt/aurorahyprland/bin/quickshell,/usr/local/bin/aurora-opal
qualification=experimental
reason=Opal is ported as the Aurora shell; first device launch and restore qualification remain.
limitations=Suspend is unavailable while Android owns the power lifecycle,Application and restore compatibility remain experimental
